=9231346089070"}]}, {"id": "901355c91fdeef05db38c6638ef90e10", "ts": "1756229263.298899", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "[PERSON_NAME_60533]", "channel": "D05SD5QLG94", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "4bfd042b604751181a3941cfd909cd97", "ts": "1756229269.446159", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Do you have some marketing visual needs?", "channel": "D05SD5QLG94", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "bf7a5827b98ab729f5aa2c89308e2319", "ts": "1756229274.106229", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Martin is out of tasks", "channel": "D05SD5QLG94", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "95bef92d255da45332fd10ca53f5f8a1", "ts": "1756230709.970659", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0008_SLACK_ID", "text": "There are needs related to video ads. But if we are just talking statics, I can't think of anything other than potentially refreshing the screenshots.", "channel": "D05SD5QLG94", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "72d7ea34ec8375807f91baf5e10d5314", "ts": "1756230794.001889", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I see, if you can think of anything else will you let him know. He's literally taskless.", "channel": "D05SD5QLG94", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "bcbfe6f7798d5b6c5f9cd6be49c40d9e", "ts": "1756232330.990849", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0008_SLACK_ID", "text": "Do you think it's fair to ask him to mock up screenshots he thinks could outperform our current set?", "channel": "D05SD5QLG94", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "122f25ba8fd177a91e7a8a9e826e0805", "ts": "1756232394.993239", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0008_SLACK_ID", "text": "I'm not the most artistic or creative guy. So I might not be the best guy to give him the vision of what the screenshots should look like.", "channel": "D05SD5QLG94", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "15b5847c6df5476a53459669fbc1ca38", "ts": "1756232453.612999", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0008_SLACK_ID", "text": "It's pretty easy to A/B test new screenshots on Google and see if a new theme improves performance. So low risk to test if we get another set of screenshots.", "channel": "D05SD5QLG94", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "465d3d6d6377c2894f98cefe4eb6c39d", "ts": "1756233569.736519", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I think it's totally fair. He definitely has a eye for composition", "channel": "D05SD5QLG94", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "288edd743c42638a28319a725c1d3f76", "ts": "1756234644.700299", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0008_SLACK_ID", "text": "I issued him a ticket. <https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ART-792/zm3d-marketing-screenshots-round-3>", "channel": "D05SD5QLG94", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": [{"app_id": "AEMQ3Q4F4", "app_unfurl_url": "https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ART-792/zm3d-marketing-screenshots-round-3", "blocks": [{"block_id": "8BLpL", "text": {"text": "<https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ART-792/zm3d-marketing-screenshots-round-3|ART-792 ZM3D - Marketing Screenshots round 3>", "type": "mrkdwn", "verbatim": true}, "type": "section"}, {"block_id": "7SpzA", "text": {"text": "Can you use your eye for composition to mock up a new set of potential screenshots to A/B test against our current set? Feel free to completely re-envision the theme. That is, don't feel like you need to follow any of the current design choices \u2014 such as limited the matching items to a single color, keeping the matching area the same size as it currently is, or even displaying the matching area at all.", "type": "mrkdwn", "verbatim": true}, "type": "section"}, {"block_id": "pfg0T", "elements": [{"text": "*State*  Team Epic", "type": "mrkdwn", "verbatim": false}, {"text": "*Assignee*  Martin Walsh", "type": "mrkdwn", "verbatim": false}], "type": "context"}, {"block_id": "3X0f1", "elements": [{"text": "<https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/team/ART/all|Art> | <!date^1756234626^{date_short_pretty} {time}|August 26, 2025>", "type": "mrkdwn", "verbatim": false}], "type": "context"}, {"block_id": "kmN3v", "elements": [{"action_id": "subscribeIssue", "text": {"emoji": true, "text": "Subscribe", "type": "plain_text"}, "type": "button", "value": "0002a8e8-b0ba-4374-a921-1fd7189894dc"}, {"action_id": "changeStatus.0002a8e8-b0ba-4374-a921-1fd7189894dc", "initial_option": {"text": {"emoji": true, "text": "Team Epic", "type": "plain_text"}, "value": "c6c